      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INGA COOPER (1) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish second, beaten half a length (17.96) at this track in a Maiden over 305m. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Sure to be about the mark. BLACK EYE FREDDY (2) still a maiden after six runs but rarely out of the placings. Hit the frame again last start finishing third (18.34) at this track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Expected to be in this for a long way. ALL I ASK (4) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last six runs. Last time finished 3rd over 300m at Murray Bridge Straight beaten 5.5 lengths (17.64) behind Achilles Legend in a Maiden on October 28. Overdue and is among the main hopes. ELECTRIC CURRENT (6) makes debut for the Kevin Patzel kennel. Can sneak into the frame at her first appearance.",
